-47"/></div></form><a href="/contact" class="contact-btn-2 w-button">Contact Us</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="drop-wrap-solution is-404"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer drop-container w-container"><div class="dropdown-solutions-2"><div class="w-layout-grid dropdown-grid"><div class="dropdown-div"><h6 class="md-16">by Solution</h6><p class="paragraph-12">RFID creates choke points at fixed read points. Our scan-free solutions provide continuous visibility with the lowest cost infrastructure, delivering real-time supply chain intelligence while minimizing errors, reducing waste, and driving ROI across enterprises.</p><ul role="list" class="list w-list-unstyled"><li><a href="/solutions/inventory-intelligence" class="nav-dropdown-links-2">Automated Cycle Count</a></li><li><a href="/solutions/automated-receiving" class="nav-dropdown-links-2">Automated Receiving</a></li><li><a href="/solutions/reusable-asset-tracking" class="nav-dropdown-links-2">Reusable Asset Tracking</a></li><li><a href="/solutions/automated-shipment-verification" class="nav-dropdown-links-2">Automated Shipment Verification</a></li><li><a href="/solutions/temperature-monitoring" class="nav-dropdown-links-2">Temperature Monitoring</a></li></ul><a href="/company" class="company-link2-2 w-inline-block"><h6 class="h6-white-2 _20">Over 180,000 assets located and millions of pounds saved in new</h6><div class="cta-lnk-arrow-2 tp-20"><div>Learn more</div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69705b4bd697a364360a4fd0/697467baf74f74ae045e354d_right-arrow.svg" alt="" class="arrow-img"/></div></a></div><div class="dropdown-div2"><h6 class="md-16">by Industry</h6><p class="paragraph-12">Explore Wiliot for retail, logistics, and quick service restaurants—improving operations with real-time visibility</p><ul role="list" class="list tp-16 w-list-unstyled"><li><a href="/applications/cpg-and-grocery" class="nav-dropdown-links-blk-2 w-inline-block"><div class="div-icon-2"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69705b4bd697a364360a4fd0/6979791fc03f2b3ab707510a_Grocery.svg" alt="" class="icon-small"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69705b4bd697a364360a4fd0/6982859dc080218c6b6f2fe6_6979791fc03f2b3ab707510a_Grocery%201.svg" alt="" class="icon-small2"/></div><div class="text-cta">Grocery</div></a><a href="/applications/retail" class="nav-dropdown-links-blk-2 w-inline-block"><div class="div-icon-2"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69705b4bd697a364360a4fd0/6979791f8b7c24375c4417e8_General%20Retail.svg" alt="" class="icon-small"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69705b4bd697a364360a4fd0/698287622ae6c922581a0cd1_General%20Retail%20(1)%201.svg" alt="" class="icon-small2"/></div><div class="text-cta">General Retail</div></a><a href="/applications/post-parcel" class="nav-dropdown-links-blk-2 w-inline-block"><div class="div-icon-2"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69705b4bd697a364360a4fd0/6979791ff0892db523d76bfb_Post%20%26%20Parcel.svg" alt="" class="icon-small"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69705b4bd697a364360a4fd0/69828a5c94a87e8fc5b51a36_Post%20%26%20Parcel%20(1)%201.svg" alt="" class="icon-small2"/></div><div class="text-cta">Post &amp; Parcel</div></a><a href="/applications/quick-service-food-restaurants" class="nav-dropdown-links-blk-2 w-inline-block"><div class="div-icon-2"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69705b4bd697a364360a4fd0/6979791fcf8dbceb3be574e5_Quick%20Service%20Restaurant.svg" alt="" class="icon-small"/><img data-w-id="555fdaba-d822-0fec-a950-637e3665b86c" loading="lazy" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/69705b4bd697a364360a4fd0/69828ad7bbf296f8455b28f0_Quick%20Service%20Restaurant%20(1)%201.svg" class="icon-small2"/></div><div class="text-cta">Quick Service Restaurant</div></a></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div cla